    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a performance for an audience that isn't there... that's exactly it. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. i look at the empty food bowl and the bed in the corner and i just wonder why i'm still here. why am i still forcing myself to wake up every morning just to feel this emptiness? it feels so much easier to just... stop. to just let it all end.",
